# 9.0/10, all 5 P1 ship-blockers pass. Tracked as audit evidence.
!runs/synthesis-metformin-v06-2026-05-02T15-15-15Z/

# Phase 6.3 expanded-corpus paper (15 contributing papers, 134 high-conf
